I have not read the full context of this thread, but I will address what 
I expect is the issue.

x2 is a property or event that is regular/recurring in time with an 
interval/property x3
x1 is likely a sumti raised from abstraction x2, and like many other 
raised-sumti places among the gismu, it exists because of natlang 
colloquial usage, e.g. "I am regular about checking email every day" 
(not really, of course %^) and "The moon is regular in revolving around 
the earth"

